{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lead, Build, and Rule Your Nation!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Presidential Rise</strong> is a <strong>strategy management</strong> game that combines <strong>simulation, politics, and building management</strong>. As the president of a rising nation, every decision you make will shape the country's future. Balance the economy, manage policies, handle public requests, and navigate political challenges to ensure stability and growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f <strong>Policy &amp; Decision-Making</strong> \u2013 Enact laws, adjust policies, and face interviews that impact your nation's direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Requests &amp; Infrastructure</strong> \u2013 Address public requests and develop infrastructure to support your country\u2019s growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcca <strong>Politics &amp; Popularity</strong> \u2013 Manage different community groups, maintain political stability, and prevent unrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Economic &amp; Export System</strong> \u2013 Manage export, stocks, and optimize the economy for long-term prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif5.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Corruption &amp; Crisis Management</strong> \u2013 Investigate corrupt officials, handle emergencies, and maintain order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif6.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you build a thriving nation or face political downfall depends on your leadership. Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926700?t=1742353005","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926700?t=1742353005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/5fc43ada70298dda2496c768e224fb8804d2e0a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742353005","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/5fc43ada70298dda2496c768e224fb8804d2e0a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742353005","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lead, Build, and Rule Your Nation!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Presidential Rise</strong> is a <strong>strategy management</strong> game that combines <strong>simulation, politics, and building management</strong>. As the president of a rising nation, every decision you make will shape the country's future. Balance the economy, manage policies, handle public requests, and navigate political challenges to ensure stability and growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f <strong>Policy &amp; Decision-Making</strong> \u2013 Enact laws, adjust policies, and face interviews that impact your nation's direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Requests &amp; Infrastructure</strong> \u2013 Address public requests and develop infrastructure to support your country\u2019s growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcca <strong>Politics &amp; Popularity</strong> \u2013 Manage different community groups, maintain political stability, and prevent unrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Economic &amp; Export System</strong> \u2013 Manage export, stocks, and optimize the economy for long-term prosperity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif5.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Corruption &amp; Crisis Management</strong> \u2013 Investigate corrupt officials, handle emergencies, and maintain order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926700/extras/Gif6.gif?t=1742353005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you build a thriving nation or face political downfall depends on your leadership. Are you ready to take on the challenge?</p>","developers":["Ilusif Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://s